  "terms_section1_title": "1. Kubvuma Zvinobvumirana",
  "terms_section1_body": "Nekushandisa application yeDa-Costa, unobvuma kuve wakasungwa neZvinobvumirana izvi. Kana usingabvumi, ushandise app.",
  "terms_section2_title": "2. Kunyoresa uye Kubhadhara",
  "terms_billing_plans_body": "App yeDa-Costa inopa kunyoresa kwePremium 'Executive Sentry'. Kubhadhara kuchatorwa muAkaundi yako yeGoogle Play pakudzokorora kutenga.",
  "terms_no_refunds_body": "Serivhisi ye-AI isingabatsi mamiriro, tinopa kukosha nekukurumidza pakuita. Zvinoenderana nemutemo wakajairika weGoogle Play, kudzoswa chikamu chezvino zvezvakabhadharwa hazvigoni. Kupinda kwako kucharsara kwegore kusvika mugumo wechiguvi chako chakabhadharwa.",
  "terms_section3_title": "3. Kushandisa Serivhisi",
  "terms_section3_body": "Da-Costa inopa zvishandiso zvekuongorora chengetedzo yeinternet. Unobvuma kushandisa serivhisi yedu chinangwa chipi nechipi chisiri pamutemo.",
  "terms_section4_title": "4. Kuwana Mari",
  "terms_section4_body": "App inoshanda pamufano wefreemium. Kushandisa kwepamahara kunonyikirwa nemidhia nezvishangu zvizere zvezuva nemazuva. Vashandisi vanogona kutenga makireditiwo edzimwe kana kunyoresa chirongwa chepremium.",
  "terms_section5_title": "5. Muganho weChemhere",
  "terms_section5_body": "Da-Costa chishandiso chekuongorora chengetedzo, kwete rubatsiro rwechengetedzo. Hatine mhosva yekukanganisa kana kurasikirwa kunobva pakushandisa kwako app.",
